{"seq":2,"slug":"democracy-authoritarianism","title":"民主与威权主义","stage":"DONE","category":"political-science","chapterCount":4,"docCount":16,"url":"/h/political-science/democracy-authoritarianism","rating":{"composite":3.63,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":4,"coverage":3.5,"positioning":4,"strategic":3},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":{"composite":3.15,"verdict":"neutral","uScore":2.25}},"introMarkdown":"# 民主与威权主义 简介\n\n民主与威权主义是理解当代政治格局最核心的一对概念。二十世纪以来，人类社会在民主化与威权回潮之间反复摆荡——第三波民主化浪潮曾让人们乐观地预言\"历史的终结\"，而近年来全球范围内的民主倒退又引发了对民主前途的深切忧虑。理解民主与威权不是简单的价值判断，而是需要深入分析不同政治体制的运作逻辑、转型条件和演变趋势。\n\n本知识库适合关注当代政治变迁、希望超越简单的\"民主好、威权坏\"二元叙事的读者。无论你是想理解民主制度为何在某些国家扎根而在另一些国家失败，还是想分析威权政体如何维持稳定和进行调适，又或是想把握当下全球政治的混合化趋势，这里都将为你提供扎实的理论工具和比较分析框架。\n\n全书共分四个章节，从理论模型到经验分析逐步展开：\n\n第一章**民主理论与模式**系统梳理民主思想的理论谱系。从自由民主的基本原则到协商民主对公共理性的强调，从参与式民主对公民行动的重视到直接民主与代议民主的经典争论，帮助你理解\"民主\"这个看似简单的词语背后丰富而复杂的理论内涵。\n\n第二章**民主转型与巩固**聚焦政治体制变迁的动态过程。从三波民主化浪潮的历史回顾到转型理论的核心命题，从民主巩固的制度条件到民主倒退的风险因素，这一章将帮助你理解民主制度的建立不是一蹴而就的事件，而是一个充满不确定性的长期过程。\n\n第三章**威权主义类型**深入分析非民主体制的多样形态。从极权主义的全面控制到竞争性威权的有限开放，从军事政权的特征到一党制国家的运作逻辑，帮助你认识到威权体制并非铁板一块，不同类型的威权政体有着截然不同的权力结构和存续机制。\n\n第四章**混合政体与民主倒退**关注当代政治中最引人注目的趋势。从混合政体概念的提出到选举威权主义的运作方式，从民粹主义对民主制度的挑战到数字威权主义的新型控制手段，这一章将帮助你理解为什么当代世界越来越多的政体难以被简单归类为民主或威权。\n\n建议从第一章开始建立民主理论的概念基础，再通过第二章理解民主化的历史经验。第三章和第四章可以结合当代国际政治的具体案例来阅读，在理论与现实的对照中加深理解。整个学习过程中，建议保持比较的视角，关注不同国家和地区的差异化经验。\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"democracy-theory","title":"民主理论与模式","docCount":4,"url":"/h/political-science/democracy-authoritarianism/democracy-theory","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"liberal-democracy","title":"自由民主","url":"/h/political-science/democracy-authoritarianism/democracy-theory/liberal-democracy"},{"seq":2,"slug":"deliberative-democracy","title":"协商民主","url":"/h/political-science/democracy-authoritarianism/democracy-theory/deliberative-democracy"},{"seq":3,"slug":"participatory-democracy","title":"参与式民主","url":"/h/political-science/democracy-authoritarianism/democracy-theory/participatory-democracy"},{"seq":4,"slug":"direct-representative","title":"直接民主与代议民主","url":"/h/political-science/democracy-authoritarianism/democracy-theory/direct-representative"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"democratic-transition","title":"民主转型与巩固","docCount":4,"url":"/h/political-science/democracy-authoritarianism/democratic-transition","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"democratization-waves","title":"民主化浪潮","url":"/h/political-science/democracy-authoritarianism/democratic-transition/democratization-waves"},{"seq":2,"slug":"transition-theory","title":"转型理论","url":"/h/political-science/democracy-authoritarianism/democratic-transition/transition-theory"},{"seq":3,"slug":"democratic-consolidation","title":"民主巩固","url":"/h/political-science/democracy-authoritarianism/democratic-transition/democratic-consolidation"},{"seq":4,"slug":"democratic-backsliding","title":"民主倒退","url":"/h/political-science/democracy-authoritarianism/democratic-transition/democratic-backsliding"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"authoritarianism-types","title":"威权主义类型","docCount":4,"url":"/h/political-science/democracy-authoritarianism/authoritarianism-types","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"totalitarianism","title":"极权主义","url":"/h/political-science/democracy-authoritarianism/authoritarianism-types/totalitarianism"},{"seq":2,"slug":"competitive-authoritarianism","title":"竞争性威权","url":"/h/political-science/democracy-authoritarianism/authoritarianism-types/competitive-authoritarianism"},{"seq":3,"slug":"military-regimes","title":"军事政权","url":"/h/political-science/democracy-authoritarianism/authoritarianism-types/military-regimes"},{"seq":4,"slug":"one-party-states","title":"一党制","url":"/h/political-science/democracy-authoritarianism/authoritarianism-types/one-party-states"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"hybrid-regimes","title":"混合政体与民主倒退","docCount":4,"url":"/h/political-science/democracy-authoritarianism/hybrid-regimes","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"hybrid-regime-concept","title":"混合政体","url":"/h/political-science/democracy-authoritarianism/hybrid-regimes/hybrid-regime-concept"},{"seq":2,"slug":"electoral-authoritarianism","title":"选举威权","url":"/h/political-science/democracy-authoritarianism/hybrid-regimes/electoral-authoritarianism"},{"seq":3,"slug":"populism-democracy","title":"民粹主义与民主","url":"/h/political-science/democracy-authoritarianism/hybrid-regimes/populism-democracy"},{"seq":4,"slug":"digital-authoritarianism","title":"数字威权主义","url":"/h/political-science/democracy-authoritarianism/hybrid-regimes/digital-authoritarianism"}]}]}